---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title="Website Usage Notice" description="How to interpret ingredient profiles and procurement discussions" lang={lang} heroTitle="Website Usage Notice" heroSubtitle="How to interpret ingredient profiles and procurement discussions">
  <div class="section-padding"><article class="container-wide prose prose-lg max-w-3xl prose-a:text-primary">
    <section><h2>Informational content, not a supply agreement</h2><p>Ingredient profiles, application concepts, articles and procurement pages provide background for business discussions. They are not binding specifications, certificates of analysis, stock confirmations, quotations or commitments to manufacture. A concept is not a validated finished-product formula or evidence of a clinical result.</p></section>
<section><h2>Confirm the specification in writing</h2><p>Before purchasing or starting development, obtain a written agreement covering the material identity, grade, test methods, acceptance criteria, documentation, quantities, pricing, delivery and responsibilities relevant to the project. Availability, sample access and feasibility require confirmation. Website copy does not replace that agreement.</p></section>
<section><h2>Application and market review</h2><p>Suitability depends on the material, dose, formulation, intended use and destination market. Buyers and product developers must arrange appropriate technical testing and regulatory review before commercialization. General website information is not medical advice, regulatory approval or a guarantee of product performance.</p></section>
<section><h2>External services and responsible use</h2><p>Links may lead to independent websites, including FormSubmit and reference sources. Their content and processing are outside this static website. Do not misuse the contact form for spam, harmful content or unauthorized disclosure of another person’s information. For questions or apparent errors in website content, contact the mailbox below.</p></section>
    <p>Contact: <a href="mailto:info@zlbotanicals.com">info@zlbotanicals.com</a></p>
    <p><a href="/privacy">Website privacy notice</a></p>
  </article></div>
</PageLayout>
